# AGAST #3513 (LARB F5, #1816): the **Checks** modules (ritz1/ARCHITECTURE.md)
# that still import an emitter* module, because they still run on, or read,
# EmitterState.  tools/test_ritz1_emitter_check_freeze.py holds the line:
#
# - a sema*.ritz (or ast_query) importing an emitter* module fails, always;
# - a Checks module importing one fails unless it is listed here;
# - a listed module that no longer imports one fails too: delete its line.
#   The list only shrinks.
#
# One module per entry, a blank line between entries, so two #1816 rooms
# deleting neighbouring entries touch no adjacent lines (#3903).

index_through

let_check

narrowing

ownership

ref_check
